sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as OGX Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Operator as OGX Operator<br/>8081/TCP health
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OGXPod as OGX Server Pod<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant Module as ogx-module<br/>8081/TCP health
    participant PlatformOp as rhods-operator

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,OGXPod: Flow 1: OGXServer Reconciliation

        User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply OGXServer CR
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-ogx-io-v1beta1-ogxserver<br/>HTTPS/9443, mTLS
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response (allow/deny)
        K8sAPI-->>User: CR created/rejected

        K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: OGXServer CR<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
        Operator->>OCI: Fetch distribution image labels<br/>HTTPS/443, Anonymous/Token
        OCI-->>Operator: Base config from OCI labels

        Note over Operator: Generate config.yaml from<br/>base config + provider specs +<br/>secret env vars

        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Patch resources<br/>ConfigMap, Deployment, Service,<br/>PVC, NetworkPolicy, HPA, PDB,<br/>ServiceMonitor, PrometheusRule<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resources created

        Operator->>OGXPod: GET /v1/health<br/>HTTP/8321, No Auth
        OGXPod-->>Operator: Health status
        Operator->>OGXPod: GET /v1/providers<br/>HTTP/8321, No Auth
        OGXPod-->>Operator: Provider info
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Update OGXServer status<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over PlatformOp,Operator: Flow 2: OGX Module Deployment

        PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create OGX CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io)
        K8sAPI->>Module: Watch event: OGX CR<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token

        Note over Module: Render root operator manifests<br/>via kustomize

        Module->>K8sAPI: Apply root operator resources<br/>(CRDs, RBAC, Deployment, Webhook)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
        K8sAPI-->>Module: Resources applied

        Module->>K8sAPI: Watch Deployments, Webhooks<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
        Module->>K8sAPI: List OGXServer CRs (health)<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
        Module->>K8sAPI: Update OGX CR status<br/>HTTPS/443, SA Token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over K8sAPI,Webhook: Flow 3: Webhook Admission

        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-ogx-io-v1beta1-ogxserver<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS (service-ca cert), mTLS
        Note over Webhook: Validates: distribution name,<br/>provider ID uniqueness,<br/>model-provider references,<br/>adoption annotations
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionReview Response<br/>HTTPS, TLS
    end
